_pdbx_nmr_details.text       
;The experiments of the conventional NOESY spectra, 3D 1H-15N NOESY and 3D 1H-13C NOESY, are conducted at 900 MHZ BRUKER AVANCE machine.  However, the other three filter-related experiments, 3D_13C,15N F1-FILTERED 13C F3-EDITED NOESY, 3D_13C,15N F1-FILTERED 15N F3-EDITED NOESY, and 2D_F2 13C,15N- FILTERED NOESY, are conducted at 800 MHZ BRUKER AVANCE machine.
;
